WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.810
A baby is carried to a font, and
water is poured over its head.

2
00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:09.940
In another family, the call to prayer
is whispered into a newborn's ear.

3
00:00:09.990 --> 00:00:12.620
Neither baby chose any of it.

4
00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:17.040
A proverb says: train up a
child in the way he should go.

5
00:00:17.090 --> 00:00:20.640
So is bringing a child up in
your faith a gift to them,

6
00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:23.020
or a choice made for them?

7
00:00:23.070 --> 00:00:27.290
In this mission, you'll follow a faith
upbringing from birth rites to home,

8
00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.250
worship and classes.

9
00:00:29.300 --> 00:00:34.540
Then you'll see how communities around a
family share the task of passing on faith.

10
00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:39.510
Your mission: weigh up whether a faith
upbringing is a gift or a choice made for

11
00:00:39.560 --> 00:00:40.280
a child.
